# Vulkan diagnostics
app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: nta Vulkan loader iri kuri iyi sisitemu, rero nta co gushushanya hakoreshejwe.\n\nSchist ishushanya ikoresheje Vulkan, kandi `libvulkan.so.1` ntishizwemwo.\nLoader na driver vyompi birakenewe:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: Vulkan driver iki kiringo cerekezako ntiriho.\n\n{var} yarashizweho, kandi kuyishiraho *bisubirira* ukurondera drivers kwa loader\naho kuvyongerako. Rero aya madosiye atariho ni yo rutonde rwose rwa drivers\n— kandi porogaramu yose ya Vulkan muri iki kiringo nta driver n'imwe ibona,\nn'aho hoba harashizwemwo nyinshi:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nYerekeze kuri manifest iriho — drivers zashizwemwo zishira izazo muri\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — canke uyikureho ureke loader yitorere izayo.\nIkiringo kibishiraho kivanye na dosiye y'imiterere (nk'iya Hyprland `env =`,\ndosiye environment.d ya systemd, canke umwirondoro wa shell) gitegerezwa\nguhindurirwa aho, kandi bisaba kwongera kwinjira kugira ihinduka rishikire\nibintu vyari bisanzwe biriko birakora.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var} yashizwe kuri {value}, kandi ivyo bisubirira ukurondera kwa loader:\nnimba ata n'imwe muri izo manifest ijanye n'iyi mashini, kuyikuraho ni co\nca mbere co kugerageza.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: nta Vulkan driver yashizwemwo, rero nta co gushushanyako.\n\nSchist ishushanya ikoresheje Vulkan. Loader irashizwemwo ariko ivuga ko ata\ndriver iriho — nta n'imwe yiyandikishije muri kimwe muri ibi bibanza bibiri bironderwamwo:\n\n{dirs}\n\nLoader itangwa ukwayo itandukanye na drivers, rero kenshi haba habuze package imwe gusa.\n\nShiramwo ijanye na GPU y'iyi mashini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nDriver ya NVIDIA yihariye izana iyayo (`nvidia-utils` kuri Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` kuri Debian). Muri mashini y'inyiganano, canke ahandi hose ata\nGPU driver yo gushiramwo, software rasteriser ni yo ikora:\n`vulkan-swrast` kuri Arch, iri muri `mesa-vulkan-drivers` ahandi. Irateba,\nariko iratangura.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: Vulkan driver irashizwemwo ariko nta gikoresho itanga co gushushanyako.\n\nDriver ishobora kuba idakorana n'iyi GPU, canke idashobora kuyishikira —\nbiciye kuri SSH, canke muri container, akenshi /dev/dri ni co kiba kibuze.\n`vulkaninfo --summary` yerekana ivyo loader ibona.\n\nNimba iyi mashini ata GPU ifise, software rasteriser irashushanya ata GPU\nikoresheje: `vulkan-swrast` kuri Arch, iri muri `mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nkuri Debian na Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Kugira utangure Schist uko biri kwose maze uyireke inanirwe mu buryo bwayo, shira {var}=1.
